<title>USA: TCI and Jones Intercable in system swap.</title>
<headline>TCI and Jones Intercable in system swap.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Co. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>TCI Communications Inc and Jones Intercable Inc said Wednesday that they completed an exchange of assets of certain of their cable systems in Colorado and Maryland.</p>
<p>Financial details of the agreements were not disclosed.</p>
<p>A TCI subsidiary received the assets of cable systems covering 26,500 customers in Colorado.</p>
<p>Jones Intercable Systems received the assets of cable systems serving 25,750 customers in Maryland.</p>
</text>
